WEBVTT

00:06.750 --> 00:11.710
We successfully retrieved our Graduate.
Good work, you two.

00:12.920 --> 00:16.290
Thanks. Now, we can finally take a brea-

00:15.130 --> 00:16.290
Let's head to our true destination.

00:18.080 --> 00:21.920
Look, I'm already super exhausted...

00:25.960 --> 00:27.170
We're here.

00:27.290 --> 00:29.250
This is as far as the car can get us.

00:29.250 --> 00:30.750
Let's check the map.

00:30.750 --> 00:32.250
<b>WIDE VIEW</b>

00:30.750 --> 00:32.250
<b>DETAILS</b>

00:32.250 --> 00:35.750
There are three tunnels.
The road ahead of us is the "New F Tunnel."

00:35.750 --> 00:36.250
<b>WIDE VIEW</b>

00:35.750 --> 00:36.250
<b>DETAILS</b>

00:35.960 --> 00:41.500
The one on the path over there is the "Old F Tunnel."

00:37.750 --> 00:39.250
<b>WIDE VIEW</b>

00:37.750 --> 00:39.250
<b>DETAILS</b>

00:41.750 --> 00:45.880
The third one that's not on the map
because it's blocked off...

00:46.130 --> 00:47.130
<b>WIDE VIEW</b>

00:46.210 --> 00:48.330
Is the "Old Old F Tunnel."

00:50.580 --> 00:53.130
Keitaro, which one feels the worst?

00:55.670 --> 00:59.460
The Old Tunnel? Gives me pretty terrible vibes...

01:00.460 --> 01:04.460
It's pressing in on me,
but in a different way than the Castle H Ruins...

01:04.630 --> 01:07.380
It feels like the air is heavy and swirling around me.

01:07.880 --> 01:13.960
The place itself doesn't have power,
but it's easy for spiritual energy to build up here.

01:14.380 --> 01:19.460
And strange things like to settle down in places like this.

01:19.750 --> 01:24.630
Our goal tonight is to catch
the Graduate-level ghost dwelling in the tunnel.

01:25.330 --> 01:29.250
Based on Keitaro's judgment just now,
we'll focus on exploring the Old Tunnel.

01:29.580 --> 01:30.330
Sound good?

01:31.880 --> 01:33.500
Let's read up on the stories.

01:34.880 --> 01:36.000
I'll get it.

01:36.000 --> 01:38.040
My bad, thanks!

01:42.750 --> 01:46.420
Wait, isn't that... the doll for the S Tunnel ghost?!

01:46.830 --> 01:49.830
I was wondering where it went off to.

01:51.130 --> 01:55.290
I thought all the dolls in your room
got consumed by the High Priest.

01:55.540 --> 01:59.920
This doll likes to escape.
Guess I should call that one of its strengths.

02:00.670 --> 02:05.920
It must have come here to escape the battle in my room.

02:06.420 --> 02:07.920
Works out for us, though.

02:08.380 --> 02:08.920
Here.

02:11.000 --> 02:12.330
Keitaro, you get these.

02:14.630 --> 02:16.540
Hold onto them just in case.

02:16.540 --> 02:22.540
Wait, this is what the Castle H spirit gave us.
Are you sure I should have it?

02:22.670 --> 02:25.040
Think about who's most likely to get attacked.

02:25.330 --> 02:27.960
Yeah, it'd be Kei-kun, 100 percent.

02:29.000 --> 02:32.080
You're gonna need to be that ready for a fight.

02:32.380 --> 02:34.290
Make sure you stick close to us, Eiko.

02:34.630 --> 02:35.290
Okay.

02:35.330 --> 02:36.630
We're ready.

02:37.630 --> 02:38.420
Let's go.

04:19.170 --> 04:25.420
This is the S-Rank haunt, the Old F Tunnel...

04:25.920 --> 04:29.080
Keitaro, do you remember what makes a spot rank as S?

04:30.420 --> 04:34.000
Yeah. Once you go there, you can't get away,

04:34.420 --> 04:39.000
either because you get trapped inside,
or you're affected by a curse that follows you forever.

04:40.210 --> 04:44.290
I dunno if it'll help, but I'll read out the stories just in case.

04:44.460 --> 04:45.170
Sure.

04:45.170 --> 04:46.210
Let's see...

04:46.580 --> 04:53.170
Everyone thinks this place is haunted
because of a specific incident that happened nearby.

04:53.330 --> 04:57.420
An intruder with an axe slaughtered
an entire family living in a teahouse.

04:58.960 --> 05:03.500
The ghosts that have been seen there
may be the victims that died that day.

05:04.080 --> 05:07.250
Here are the things people say about the tunnel itself:

05:08.540 --> 05:12.960
One: A woman wearing a white kimono.

05:13.790 --> 05:16.670
Two: Look behind you when you're in the tunnel,

05:18.420 --> 05:21.040
and you'll see a scary ghost is chasing you.

05:21.630 --> 05:28.290
Three: Bloody marks on the wall
from where an old woman was hit by a truck.

05:29.250 --> 05:33.000
Four: Voices coming from within.

05:33.380 --> 05:39.080
Five: A curved traffic mirror that shouldn't be there
appears near the entrance,

05:40.040 --> 05:42.960
and a terrible accident will happen
to anyone who looks into it.

05:44.130 --> 05:48.130
Six: People mysteriously go missing... The list goes on.

05:48.790 --> 05:51.040
Let's see if those rumors are true.

05:52.040 --> 05:52.750
Mm-hmm.

05:57.040 --> 05:59.460
A curved traffic mirror that shouldn't be there...

06:00.540 --> 06:05.250
How are we supposed to know
if it's supposed to be there or not, though?

06:05.250 --> 06:06.330
Yeah...

06:08.420 --> 06:12.250
Wait! I can compare this with the photo
from that blog I was reading...

06:11.080 --> 06:12.210
<b>HAUNTED PLACES:</b>

06:11.080 --> 06:12.210
<b>OLD F TUNNEL</b>

06:12.830 --> 06:13.080
<b>HAUNTED PLACES:</b>

06:12.830 --> 06:13.080
<b>OLD F TUNNEL</b>

06:14.380 --> 06:15.880
How's it look, Eiko?

06:16.830 --> 06:18.210
It's loading really slow...

06:20.920 --> 06:22.790
Forget it. Let's head in.

06:23.830 --> 06:26.630
Hey! Hold up, Yayoi-chan!

06:29.710 --> 06:31.040
<b>NO SERVICE</b>

06:29.960 --> 06:32.880
What the...? I suddenly lost service.

06:38.250 --> 06:40.580
Yayoi-chan? Kei-kun?

06:44.380 --> 06:45.580
Someone's coming!

06:46.880 --> 06:49.170
And it's not either of them...

06:52.080 --> 06:56.080
Wait, what? Another person? Talk about crazy!

06:56.290 --> 06:58.210
Huh?! A girl?

06:58.790 --> 07:00.000
Wait, though...

07:00.420 --> 07:06.000
Um, another? Did you just pass a man and a little girl?

07:06.170 --> 07:09.580
Yeah, I walked past them. Do you know them?

07:09.830 --> 07:10.670
Yeah!

07:10.670 --> 07:14.580
Wait, are you here 'cause you wanna see if it's haunted?!

07:15.290 --> 07:16.290
Yeah, that's right.

07:16.330 --> 07:19.250
I knew it! This rules!

07:19.420 --> 07:21.080
I'm Anna Misaki!

07:21.210 --> 07:23.960
I'm a YouTuber who explores haunted places!

07:25.710 --> 07:31.330
I chickened out halfway through the tunnel,
but I wanna go back and get more footage!

07:31.750 --> 07:36.130
So, it's pretty scary in there.
I dunno if anyone should go in alone.

07:36.250 --> 07:38.170
Sorry, what was your name?

07:38.170 --> 07:40.460
Oh, I'm Eiko Hozuki!

07:40.460 --> 07:43.080
Oh, cool, cool! Hi, Eiko!

07:43.380 --> 07:45.460
You can call me Anna.

07:48.040 --> 07:52.130
I'm so sorry. I bet you didn't expect
anyone else at this time of night.

07:52.330 --> 07:58.210
I bet you didn't, either! Like, no one would come here
unless they liked scary stories.

07:58.580 --> 08:01.290
But it's so cool meeting someone else
who's just as into it as I am!

08:01.290 --> 08:03.000
Right?! Big same!

08:03.210 --> 08:07.210
Plus, most people who like scary stuff
wouldn't come all the way out here!

08:07.460 --> 08:10.750
So Eiko, how much of this tunnel's lore do you know?

08:10.960 --> 08:13.500
I read the stuff that's available online.

08:13.540 --> 08:16.290
Cool. So you know that one story?

08:16.750 --> 08:17.500
Which one?

08:18.170 --> 08:21.330
The one about the psycho killer ghost.

08:22.380 --> 08:25.630
Is that about the family that got murdered near here?

08:25.920 --> 08:31.670
It's probably related? I heard about this one
direct from my friend, though.

08:32.460 --> 08:38.080
It's the one where after the ghost in the tunnel
chases you down, it cuts you into pieces.

08:38.630 --> 08:39.460
So...

08:42.750 --> 08:43.750
That's the exit.

08:43.750 --> 08:44.540
Already?!

08:44.540 --> 08:47.330
I guess it went fast 'cause we were talking.

08:48.330 --> 08:50.540
We didn't see your friends.

08:50.540 --> 08:53.420
Maybe they went further down the road.

08:53.580 --> 08:55.920
Hey, they couldn't have gone too far.

08:58.920 --> 08:59.580
Huh?

09:11.790 --> 09:13.880
Wait... This is the entrance.

09:14.630 --> 09:17.080
But we just went through the exit...

09:17.500 --> 09:20.540
Yeah. Let's get out.

09:27.630 --> 09:29.420
We're back at the exit?

09:33.960 --> 09:34.830
Eiko?!

09:37.170 --> 09:38.920
Where does it look like I'm at?

09:40.580 --> 09:43.330
You look like you're outside the tunnel.

09:49.880 --> 09:52.170
That's not what it looks like to me.

09:52.170 --> 09:52.880
What?

09:52.880 --> 09:53.960
Hold on.

09:54.540 --> 09:57.670
So, we can't leave the tunnel...?

09:58.540 --> 09:59.920
Eiko... what's that?

10:01.080 --> 10:04.040
I don't remember those being there earlier...

10:04.330 --> 10:06.710
I don't, either. What even are they?

10:06.880 --> 10:11.880
They look like fish roe egg sacs... But they're too big.

10:12.790 --> 10:15.080
I kinda don't wanna be here anymore.

10:15.290 --> 10:16.000
Same...

10:16.210 --> 10:19.290
But hey, I was able to go out and come back,

10:19.500 --> 10:22.500
so maybe if we keep going back and forth,
we'll be able to get out!

10:22.670 --> 10:26.330
Y-yeah! Not like standing around here's gonna help!

10:35.920 --> 10:39.540
Lemme finish that story I was telling you!

10:39.540 --> 10:40.630
Are you for real?!

10:40.630 --> 10:45.290
What, don't tell me you're chicken, Eiko!
I thought you liked scary stuff!

10:45.290 --> 10:48.170
I-I'm not chicken! Bring it!

10:48.170 --> 10:50.630
C-cool, let's get into it!

10:50.710 --> 10:52.000
I'm an idiot!

10:53.330 --> 10:59.960
So that ghost, the scariest thing about it
is how it chases you with a big ol' axe,

11:00.250 --> 11:03.170
then once it catches you, it slices you up into pieces.

11:03.710 --> 11:08.830
But to me, the scariest part
is what it does to you before it kills you.

11:09.540 --> 11:10.380
The exit...

11:17.250 --> 11:19.880
Uh, are there more now...?

11:20.670 --> 11:22.380
L-let's just go outside!

11:22.580 --> 11:23.330
Yeah!

11:31.170 --> 11:33.540
We're back again.

11:35.710 --> 11:37.170
A-Anna?

11:38.580 --> 11:40.630
L-look, let's just keep going!

11:41.250 --> 11:41.880
Okay.

11:47.290 --> 11:51.330
Keitaro, do you feel anything
coming from the Old Old F Tunnel?

11:51.330 --> 11:52.920
Huh? No, I don't.

11:53.130 --> 11:56.000
Do you feel anything strange
from this Old F Tunnel right now?

11:56.710 --> 11:59.080
Yeah, kinda.

11:59.080 --> 12:03.920
One more question.
Where do you feel it coming from, specifically?

12:04.460 --> 12:05.170
Huh?

12:12.170 --> 12:13.130
Figure it out?

12:13.960 --> 12:16.000
That thing you thought was Eiko...

12:17.420 --> 12:21.750
...has looked totally different to me this whole time.

12:26.290 --> 12:28.080
Why didn't you tell me?

12:28.380 --> 12:30.290
The spirit took Eiko somewhere.

12:31.170 --> 12:34.210
If I'd attacked it while we were outside,

12:34.210 --> 12:37.540
you might've tried to stop me,
and it would've gotten away.

12:38.130 --> 12:40.790
Then we'd lose our only clue for finding Eiko.

12:41.380 --> 12:44.290
That's why I waited till we were halfway down the tunnel.

12:44.960 --> 12:47.880
Now, we can have it lead us...

12:48.580 --> 12:50.330
...to where Eiko is.

12:55.790 --> 12:58.540
So, Eiko, to finish my story...

12:58.790 --> 13:01.500
What?! Is this really the time?!

13:01.750 --> 13:03.790
C-can we talk about something else?

13:03.790 --> 13:05.750
When the ghost catches you,

13:06.420 --> 13:11.880
it starts by cutting your legs off from the thigh,
so you can't run away.

13:12.830 --> 13:18.630
Then, it cuts off your arms, so you can't fight back.

13:20.670 --> 13:21.540
The exit...

13:21.540 --> 13:26.920
After that, it rips out every one of your organs,
except the ones you need to stay alive...

13:28.670 --> 13:30.420
...and it lays them all out.

13:39.130 --> 13:39.830
Then...

13:44.250 --> 13:50.170
...it waits for its helpless victims to scream,
"I want to die! Kill me!"

13:50.540 --> 13:54.540
Then, just as they think it'll finally end them...

13:55.330 --> 13:58.670
It keeps them alive as it flays the skin from their face.

13:59.670 --> 14:06.210
Then it made me watch...
as it wore my own face as a mask.

14:06.960 --> 14:14.210
Then, it shoved its axe into my forehead,
rocking it slowly into my skull.

14:15.080 --> 14:19.250
It's funny. I should have been screaming for it to kill me,

14:19.500 --> 14:22.500
but... for some reason,

14:20.420 --> 14:29.710
Stop, stop! It hurts! Someone, save me, please!

14:23.000 --> 14:25.880
I kept screaming for my life to be spared
until my throat was raw.

14:27.670 --> 14:29.710
And I had to look at my own face while it did it...

14:34.210 --> 14:35.460
...until I finally died.

14:40.000 --> 14:41.460
What was that?

14:42.290 --> 14:45.040
The past and the future.

14:48.290 --> 14:49.380
My past...

14:50.250 --> 14:51.130
...and your future.

14:55.000 --> 14:56.130
Ow...

14:59.250 --> 15:00.130
I'm outside?

15:01.750 --> 15:02.710
I can escape!

15:07.080 --> 15:08.290
It's a dead end...

15:09.710 --> 15:13.500
The road should've kept going after the tunnel, though...

15:14.080 --> 15:16.540
But why is there a metal door blocking it?

15:17.210 --> 15:19.250
Is that the Old Old F Tunnel?

15:21.330 --> 15:28.380
When I was attacked, the friend that was with me
was really brave and tried to help me.

15:28.790 --> 15:33.670
But y'know, I didn't want her to save me at all.

15:34.250 --> 15:38.290
I watched her get caught and tortured just like I did...

15:38.420 --> 15:40.080
And it made me feel good.

15:41.000 --> 15:42.960
Now, I wasn't alone.

15:44.040 --> 15:49.080
I don't wanna be the only one who had to suffer.

15:49.580 --> 15:52.880
Thanks for coming with me.

15:53.040 --> 15:55.210
Let's suffer together, okay?

15:56.790 --> 15:57.960
Eiko.

16:37.920 --> 16:40.080
Once you go there, you can't get away,

16:40.500 --> 16:43.830
either because you get trapped inside,
or you're affected by a curse that follows you forever.

16:55.920 --> 16:58.830
Seeing me grossed you out, huh?

16:59.500 --> 17:01.920
It's okay. Soon, we'll match.

17:23.250 --> 17:25.040
H-hold on...

17:26.420 --> 17:29.130
Nothing happened to us.

17:29.670 --> 17:30.790
That means...

17:34.790 --> 17:38.630
Yayoi-chan. I feel something really cold
from up above us.

17:39.170 --> 17:42.670
Like something is leaking out from around its seal...

17:43.250 --> 17:47.330
The worst of it isn't here. It's in the other tunnel.

17:47.710 --> 17:50.040
In the Old Old F Tunnel.

17:50.630 --> 17:51.580
And that's...

17:53.880 --> 17:55.170
...where Eiko is.

18:08.670 --> 18:09.630
Was that...

18:11.380 --> 18:12.580
...her memory?

18:13.580 --> 18:16.630
I just wanted to save my friend.

18:20.330 --> 18:21.290
But she...

18:22.170 --> 18:23.960
She didn't want me to save her...

18:25.130 --> 18:26.750
She wanted me to come with her.

18:28.920 --> 18:32.880
That should happen to you, too! To everyone!

18:32.880 --> 18:37.250
Everyone should die! Everyone should be torn apart!

18:37.250 --> 18:39.500
Okay, then take us there.

18:40.000 --> 18:41.040
Take us where?

18:42.170 --> 18:43.920
To where the spirit is?

18:46.080 --> 18:46.920
No...

18:47.920 --> 18:49.130
Eiko's in trouble.

18:49.710 --> 18:50.580
We have to hurry.

20:12.000 --> 20:14.000
You're next, Eiko.

20:19.040 --> 20:22.040
NOOOO!

20:28.210 --> 20:29.210
EIKO!

20:30.000 --> 20:31.960
KEI-KUN! YAYOI-CHAN!

20:43.920 --> 20:48.000
It's taunting us. Telling us to follow if we want to save her.

20:48.710 --> 20:51.580
It was wearing the face of the S Tunnel ghost.

20:52.000 --> 20:57.290
That ghost was just as much of a threat to it
as any normal human being.

20:58.130 --> 21:01.080
We're going into the tunnel.

21:01.750 --> 21:05.500
It'll be very dangerous.
I'm going to lay out our priorities and ground rules.

21:06.670 --> 21:10.000
First, our top priority is getting Eiko out safe.

21:11.210 --> 21:17.790
Next, the Old Old F Tunnel is run-down and unstable. 
It could collapse if things get too rough in there.

21:18.500 --> 21:22.130
That's also the reason we won't use
any Graduate-tier spirits in there.

21:22.630 --> 21:26.580
From what I know, they'll absolutely end up
damaging their narrow surroundings.

21:27.080 --> 21:32.210
So, if we're going to fight this spirit,
we need to do it outside the tunnel.

21:32.630 --> 21:34.290
Until then, we hold out.

21:34.960 --> 21:37.460
But if we get it outside, we can definitely take it.

21:38.170 --> 21:38.920
Got all that?

21:40.130 --> 21:41.540
Yeah. Let's go!

23:22.210 --> 23:30.540
Yayoi and Keitaro head into
the Old Old F Tunnel to rescue Eiko.

23:30.920 --> 23:33.630
An evil, cruel spirit stands in their way.

23:35.170 --> 23:38.750
Yayoi unleashes a weapon to drive it back.
